# If you want to keep sdkconfig in version control, comment the lines above and keep sdkconfig.defaults as the source of truth.
# This project keeps sdkconfig.defaults (LFN_HEAP, BUTTON_B=-1, PSRAM octal) and generates sdkconfig on build.

# IDF Component Manager
# Uncomment to ignore managed components (they are re-fetched from idf_component.yml).
# This project patches waveshare__esp32_s3_touch_amoled_1_8 for touch/power robustness,
# so it is kept tracked. To ignore upstream components, uncomment:
# managed_components/

# Keep dependencies.lock for reproducible builds (comment to ignore)
